"The Student Portal is the online self-service page where active students log"
" in to manage their Study Plan (KRS), view Study Result Cards (KHS) and GPA,"
" and track their Thesis and Yudisium progress."
msgstr ""
"Portal Mahasiswa adalah halaman layanan mandiri online bagi mahasiswa aktif "
"untuk mengisi KRS, melihat KHS dan IPK, serta memantau proses Skripsi dan "
"Yudisium."

#. module: campus_portal
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:campus_portal.portal_homepage_docs
