msgid ""
"Once your subjects and total SKS are ready, click <strong>Submit "
"KRS</strong> to send it to your Academic Advisor (PA)."
msgstr ""
"Jika daftar mata kuliah dan total SKS sudah sesuai, klik <strong>Ajukan "
"KRS</strong> untuk mengirimnya ke Dosen PA."

#. module: campus_portal
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:campus_portal.portal_homepage_docs
msgid ""
"<i class=\"fa fa-exclamation-triangle text-danger me-2\"/> <strong>System "
"Rules &amp; Validations (What to do if blocked):</strong>"
msgstr ""
"<i class=\"fa fa-exclamation-triangle text-danger me-2\"/> <strong>Aturan "
"&amp; Validasi Sistem (Apa yang harus dilakukan jika tertahan):</strong>"

#. module: campus_portal
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:campus_portal.portal_homepage_docs
msgid ""
"<strong>Only Editable in Draft / Revision:</strong> You cannot add or remove"
" subjects once the KRS is <em>Submitted</em>, <em>Approved</em>, or "
"<em>Locked</em>. If you need changes after submitting, ask your Academic "
"Advisor to return it for revision."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Hanya Bisa Diubah Saat Draf / Revisi:</strong> Anda tidak bisa "
"menambah atau menghapus mata kuliah jika KRS sudah berstatus "
"<em>Diajukan</em>, <em>Disetujui</em>, atau <em>Dikunci</em>. Jika perlu "
"perubahan setelah diajukan, minta Dosen PA mengembalikannya untuk direvisi."

#. module: campus_portal
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:campus_portal.portal_homepage_docs
msgid ""
"<strong>KRS Period Must Be Open:</strong> Students can only edit KRS within "
"the active KRS dates. Outside this period, contact Academic Admin."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Periode KRS Harus Sedang Buka:</strong> Mahasiswa hanya dapat "
"mengubah KRS dalam rentang tanggal periode KRS aktif. Di luar jadwal "
"tersebut, hubungi Admin Akademik."

#. module: campus_portal
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:campus_portal.portal_homepage_docs
msgid ""
"<strong>Automatic Checks on \"Take\":</strong> The portal immediately blocks"
" and shows an alert banner if adding a class exceeds your GPA SKS limit, "
"overlaps with another chosen schedule, has a full classroom, or misses a "
"prerequisite subject."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Pemeriksaan Otomatis Saat Klik \"Ambil\":</strong> Portal langsung "
"menahan dan menampilkan pesan peringatan jika kelas yang dipilih melebihi "
"batas SKS IPK Anda, jadwalnya bentrok, kuota kelas sudah penuh, atau mata "
"kuliah prasyaratnya belum lulus."

#. module: campus_portal
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:campus_portal.portal_homepage_docs
msgid "Stage 3: Viewing KHS &amp; GPA"
msgstr "Tahap 3: Melihat KHS &amp; IPK"

#. module: campus_portal
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:campus_portal.portal_homepage_docs
msgid ""
"Open the <strong>KHS</strong> menu to see your subjects, letter grades, "
"semester GPA (IP), and cumulative GPA (IPK). Grades appear automatically as "
"soon as your lecturer enters them."
msgstr ""
"Buka menu <strong>KHS</strong> untuk melihat daftar mata kuliah, nilai "
"huruf, IP semester, dan IPK. Nilai akan langsung tampil segera setelah dosen"
" pengampu menginputkannya."

#. module: campus_portal
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:campus_portal.portal_homepage_docs
msgid "Stage 4: Tracking Thesis &amp; Uploading Yudisium Documents"
msgstr "Tahap 4: Memantau Skripsi &amp; Unggah Berkas Yudisium"

#. module: campus_portal
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:campus_portal.portal_homepage_docs
msgid "<strong>Who performs this:</strong> Final-Year Student"
msgstr "<strong>Pelaksana:</strong> Mahasiswa Tingkat Akhir"

#. module: campus_portal
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:campus_portal.portal_homepage_docs
msgid ""
"Open <strong>My Thesis</strong> (<code>/my/thesis</code>) to register your "
"thesis, add consultation progress notes, upload Yudisium clearance "
"documents, and download your Graduation Clearance Sheet PDF once approved."
msgstr ""
"Buka menu <strong>Skripsi Saya</strong> (<code>/my/thesis</code>) untuk "
"mendaftarkan skripsi, mencatat progres bimbingan, mengunggah berkas "
"yudisium, dan mengunduh Surat Keterangan Lulus/Yudisium (PDF) setelah "
"disetujui."

#. module: campus_portal
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:campus_portal.portal_homepage_docs
msgid "<i class=\"fa fa-lock text-dark me-2\"/> Student Data Privacy"
msgstr "<i class=\"fa fa-lock text-dark me-2\"/> Privasi Data Mahasiswa"

#. module: campus_portal
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:campus_portal.portal_homepage_docs
msgid ""
"Each student account can only view and edit its own KRS, KHS, and Thesis "
"records. If someone tries to open another student's document link directly, "
"the system automatically blocks access so personal academic records stay "
"private."
msgstr ""
"Setiap akun mahasiswa hanya dapat melihat dan mengelola KRS, KHS, dan "
"Skripsi miliknya sendiri. Jika ada yang mencoba membuka tautan dokumen milik"
" mahasiswa lain, sistem otomatis memblokirnya agar data akademik tetap aman."
